From ee4c4900e4f16001b93595b44350cfef3e9a8e89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josh M <joshlm2947@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 18:00:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Implement instructions used by Peggle 2

Integer: addc, addme, subfze, eqv, mulhdu.
Branches: bdzf, bdnzt, bso, bns (via a crBit helper that honours the BI operand).
Loads/stores with update: lbzux, lhzu, lhzux, lhau, lwzux, lwaux, ldux,
lfsu, lfsux, lfdu, lfdux, stbux, sthu, sthux, stdux, stfsu, stfsux, stfdu.
Vector: lvebx, lvehx, vaddsws, vavguh, vcmpgtsb, vcmpgtsw, vmaxuh, vminsw,
vminuh, vpkswss(128), vsel128, vslh, vspltish, vsrah, vsrh, vsubshs,
vsububm, vsubuwm.
Other: dcbst, frsqrte.

